      "controls": {},
      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Random is Count numbers between Min and Max, each chosen by the Seed and its own place in the list, so the same seed always gives the same sky. Four of them place, size and turn the stars of a Stamp on Points; the beat count steps every Seed once a second, each from its own start, and the sky is drawn again. Try a bigger Count on the X and Y Randoms \u2014 the stars already there stay put."
        }
      },
